WEBVTT

00:02.145 --> 00:09.018
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:09.018 --> 00:12.422
- AS CONSORT
TO THE SPIRIT WORLD,
- 作为驸马
到精神世界，

00:12.422 --> 00:16.326
I NOW COMMENCE THIS SEANCE.
我现在开始这次降神会。

00:16.326 --> 00:22.031
PLOOBUS PLORUM
SPAGHETTI GRANOLUM.
普洛布斯普洛鲁姆
意大利面麦片。

00:22.031 --> 00:26.536
I NOW SUMMON THE UN-LIVING.
我现在召唤亡灵。

00:32.975 --> 00:35.711
[eerie hum]
[诡异的嗡嗡声]

00:38.648 --> 00:40.250
- WHY HAVE YOU DISTURBED ME?
- 你为什么打扰我？

00:40.250 --> 00:42.017
- BECAUSE...
- 因为...

00:42.017 --> 00:46.956
YOU KEEP FORGETTING TO REPLACE
THE TOILET PAPER ROLL.
您总是忘记更换
卫生纸卷。

00:50.059 --> 00:54.029
AS ROOMMATES,
WE ALL HAVE TO DO OUR PART.
作为室友，
我们都必须尽自己的一份力量。

00:54.029 --> 00:56.732
- I KNOW,
BUT IT WASN'T ME THIS TIME.
- 我知道，
但这一次不是我。

00:56.732 --> 00:58.801
'TWAS GALE WHO LEFT THINGS...
- [gasps]
“是大风留下的东西……”
- [喘气]

00:58.801 --> 01:00.203
- UNREPLENISHED.
- 未补充。

01:00.203 --> 01:02.071
- GALE?
- SORRY.
- 大风？
- 对不起。

01:02.071 --> 01:05.341
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:05.341 --> 01:08.211
- [laughs] HOW CHEESY.
- [笑]多么俗气。

01:08.211 --> 01:11.281
WHO COULD EVER
BE FRIGHTENED BY THAT?
谁能
对此感到害怕吗？

01:11.281 --> 01:13.249
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

01:13.249 --> 01:16.051
- HEY. MOISTBOB DRIPPANTS,
YOU MIND?
- 嘿。 MOISTBOB 滴尿裤，
你介意吗？

01:16.051 --> 01:19.355
- SORRY, SQUIDWARD, I'VE JUST
NEVER SEEN A SEANCE BEFORE.
- 对不起，章鱼哥，我刚刚
以前从未见过降神会。

01:19.355 --> 01:22.825
- WELL, TRY TO CONTAIN YOURSELF.
WE HAVE A CUSTOMER.
- 好吧，尽量克制自己。
我们有一个客户。

01:22.825 --> 01:26.762
- I'LL HAVE ME
A "RUSTY ON RYE," PLEASE.
- 我会拥有我
请来一首“生锈的黑麦”。

01:26.762 --> 01:28.831
- CHARMING COLLOQUIALISM,
- 迷人的口语，

01:28.831 --> 01:32.268
BUT LET'S TRY SOMETHING
THAT'S ACTUALLY ON THE MENU.
但让我们尝试一下
这实际上在菜单上。

01:32.268 --> 01:34.737
- STOP GIVIN' ME
THE RUNAROUND, CITY BOY!
- 别再给我了
奔跑吧，城市男孩！

01:34.737 --> 01:38.107
I WANT A "RUSTY ON RYE,"
AND NOTHIN' LESS!
我想要一杯“生锈的黑麦”
一点也不差！

01:38.107 --> 01:40.810
- JUST LEAVE IT TO ME,
OH, RUSTY ONE.
- 交给我吧
哦，生锈的一个。

01:40.810 --> 01:42.512
PREPARE FOR A--
准备好——

01:42.512 --> 01:45.881
WHAT THE BARNACLE
IS A "RUSTY ON RYE"?
什么是藤壶
是“生锈的黑麦”吗？

01:49.018 --> 01:51.221
LET'S SEE, "R," "R..."
让我们看看，“R”，“R……”

01:51.221 --> 01:54.390
"RAMBLIN' HAM," "RED HERRING,"
"RIB-TICKLER,"
“兰布林火腿”、“红鲱鱼”
“肋排-痒痒的，”

01:54.390 --> 01:57.126
"RUSTY PENGUIN,"
"SALTY STEAMER."
“生锈的企鹅”
“咸蒸锅。”

01:57.126 --> 02:00.596
OH, GUESS I DON'T KNOW
HOW TO MAKE A "RUSTY ON RYE."
哦，我想我不知道
如何制作“生锈的黑麦”。

02:00.596 --> 02:02.064
BUT I CAN CERTAINLY LEARN.
但我当然可以学习。

02:02.064 --> 02:03.899
HELP ME OUT, SIR,
COULD YOU CLUE ME IN
救救我吧，先生，
你能告诉我吗

02:03.899 --> 02:06.236
TO WHAT WAS IN YOUR
BELOVED "RUSTY ON RYE"?
你的内容
心爱的“黑麦生锈”？

02:06.236 --> 02:11.307
- HUH? WELL, LET'S SEE...
I THINK IT WAS ON RYE BREAD.
- 嗯？好吧，让我们看看...
我想是在黑麦面包上。

02:11.307 --> 02:13.809
IT WAS NUMBER NINE
ON THE MENU.
这是九号
在菜单上。

02:13.809 --> 02:16.712
IT CAME WITH A SIDE
OF SOMETHIN' OR OTHER, UM--
它有一个侧面
某事或其他的，嗯——

02:16.712 --> 02:17.980
- OH, COME ON!
- 哦，来吧！

02:17.980 --> 02:20.115
ARE YOU GONNA ORDER A PATTY
OR WHAT, POPS?
你要点一份肉饼吗
或者什么，POPS？

02:20.115 --> 02:21.884
- LET'S GET IT MOVIN' HERE!
[overlapping yelling]
- 让我们开始吧！
[重叠的叫喊]

02:21.884 --> 02:23.653
- WHAT'S THE BIG KERFUFFLE?
- 什么是大混乱？

02:23.653 --> 02:25.488
OH, IT'S YOU.
哦，是你。

02:25.488 --> 02:28.458
ONLY WHAT'S ON THE MENU,
OLD-TIMER.
仅限菜单上的内容，
老前辈。

02:28.458 --> 02:31.961
- THIS AIN'T NO KINDA WAY
TO TREAT A LOYAL CUSTOMER!
- 这不是办法
对待忠诚的客户！

02:31.961 --> 02:35.531
- [laughs]
WELL, THAT'S A FIRST FOR YOU,
- [笑]
嗯，这对你来说是第一次，

02:35.531 --> 02:37.933
AN UNSATISFIED CUSTOMER.
一位不满意的客户。

02:37.933 --> 02:39.669
- [gasps] NO!
- [喘气] 不！

02:39.669 --> 02:41.437
[sobbing] NO!
[抽泣]不！

02:41.437 --> 02:44.840
MR. KRABS, THERE WAS
AN UNSATISFIED CUSTOMER.
先生。蟹蟹，有
一位不满意的客户。

02:44.840 --> 02:47.277
WHY DON'T WE SERVE
THE "RUSTY ON RYE" ANYMORE?
我们为什么不服务
“黑麦生锈”了？

02:47.277 --> 02:48.978
- BECAUSE WE NEVER DID.
- 因为我们从来没有这样做过。

02:48.978 --> 02:51.881
THAT SANDWICH WAS ON THE MENU
OF AN OLD RESTAURANT,
菜单上有那个三明治
一家老餐馆的，

02:51.881 --> 02:54.984
ONE THAT STOOD HERE
LONG BEFORE THE KRUSTY KRAB.
站在这里的一个
早在甲壳蟹出现之前。

02:54.984 --> 02:59.021
'TWAS AN OLD RAMSHACKLE SHACK
CALLED "RUSTY'S RIB EYE,"
那是一间摇摇欲坠的破旧小屋
叫做“生锈的肋眼牛排”

02:59.021 --> 03:01.291
AND THE ONLY ONE WHO EVER KNEW
HOW TO MAKE THAT SANDWICH
并且是唯一一个知道的人
如何制作三明治

03:01.291 --> 03:04.126
WAS THE OWNER, RUSTY RICKETS.
是主人，生锈的佝偻病。

03:04.126 --> 03:07.997
HOWEVER, OLD RUSTY
BOUGHT THE FARM 20 YEARS AGO.
然而，老生锈
20 年前买下了农场。

03:07.997 --> 03:09.632
- OOH.
- NOPE.
-哦。
- 没有。

03:09.632 --> 03:11.000
YOU AIN'T GETTIN' THAT RECIPE
你不明白那个食谱

03:11.000 --> 03:14.470
UNLESS YOU'RE VERSED
IN TALKING TO THE UN-LIVING.
除非你精通
与死者交谈。

03:14.470 --> 03:18.508
- I BELIEVE I'VE SEEN A PROGRAM
ON THIS MATTER.
- 我相信我看过一个节目
关于这件事。

03:18.508 --> 03:20.310
- EH, SCRAM.
- 呃，紧急停止。

03:20.310 --> 03:22.378
THIS CONVERSATION'S
MAKING ME DIZZY.
这次谈话的
让我头晕。

03:22.378 --> 03:24.480
- I MAY BE ABLE
TO GET THAT RECIPE AFTER ALL.
- 我也许可以
毕竟要得到那个食谱。

03:24.480 --> 03:26.582
I JUST NEED
TO CALL IN A FAVOR.
我只需要
寻求帮助。

03:26.582 --> 03:29.084
HI, PATRICK.
SPONGEBOB HERE.
嗨，帕特里克。
海绵宝宝在这里。

03:29.084 --> 03:31.321
YEAH, THE ONE
WITH SQUARE PANTS, MM-HMM.
是的，就是那个
搭配四角裤，嗯嗯。

03:31.321 --> 03:32.988
HEY, LISTEN, COULD YOU
MEET ME AFTER WORK?
嘿，听着，你可以吗？
下班后来见我吗？

03:32.988 --> 03:34.524
I NEED YOUR HELP
WITH SOMETHING.
我需要你的帮助
有东西。

03:34.524 --> 03:37.493
YOUR BEST FRIEND,
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
您最好的朋友，
海绵宝宝。

03:40.996 --> 03:43.399
- GOOD NIGHT, KIDDO.
- GOOD NIGHT, BOSS MAN.
- 晚安，孩子。
- 晚安，老板。

03:43.399 --> 03:44.967
PATRICK AND I WILL LOCK UP.
帕特里克和我会锁门。

03:44.967 --> 03:47.637
- FINE,
BUT NO EATIN' ME INVENTORY.
- 很好，
但不要吃掉我的库存。

03:47.637 --> 03:50.373
- OKAY.
- OR ME FURNITURE.
- 好的。
- 或者我的家具。

03:50.373 --> 03:52.775
- WHAT?
COME ON, BOSS MAN!
- 什么？
来吧，老板！

03:52.775 --> 03:55.378
WE CAN'T EAT ANYTHING,
WHY ARE WE HERE?
我们什么都不能吃
我们为什么在这里？

03:55.378 --> 03:57.780
- AH, SIMPLE,
MY FIVE-POINTED FRIEND.
- 啊，简单，
我的五点朋友。

03:57.780 --> 04:01.351
ON THIS NIGHT,
WE SHALL MAKE CONTACT
在这个夜晚，
我们将联系

04:01.351 --> 04:04.354
WITH THE UN-LIVING!
与无生命者一起！

04:04.354 --> 04:08.358
BY PERFORMING...A SEANCE!
通过表演...降神会！

04:10.025 --> 04:12.362
- THEN CAN WE EAT
SOME FURNITURE?
- 那我们可以吃饭了吗
一些家具？

04:12.362 --> 04:14.063
- NO.
- [screams]
- 不。
- [尖叫]

04:14.063 --> 04:17.232
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:23.072 --> 04:25.375
- AS CONSORT
TO THE SPIRIT WORLD,
- 作为驸马
到精神世界，

04:25.375 --> 04:28.411
I NOW COMMENCE THIS SEANCE.
我现在开始这次降神会。

04:28.411 --> 04:31.914
I SHALL INVOKE
THE SPECTER OF RUSTY RICKETS
我将调用
生锈佝偻病的幽灵

04:31.914 --> 04:34.650
BY READING
FROM THE SACRED TEXT.
通过阅读
来自神圣的文本。

04:34.650 --> 04:40.390
"DISTILLED VINEGAR, WATER,
NUMBER ONE MUSTARD SEED,
“蒸馏醋、水、
一号芥菜籽，

04:40.390 --> 04:45.528
SALT, TURMERIC, PAPRIKA,
NATURAL FLAVORS."
盐、姜黄、辣椒粉、
天然风味。”

04:45.528 --> 04:49.799
I NOW SUMMON
THE SPIRIT OF RUSTY RICKETS.
我现在召唤
生锈佝偻病的精神。

04:52.735 --> 04:57.407
KNOW, TOO, THAT I BECKON
THE SPIRIT OF RUSTY'S RIB EYE.
我也知道我在召唤
鲁斯蒂肋眼牛排的灵魂。

04:57.407 --> 04:58.508
[thunder clap]
[雷鸣般的掌声]

05:04.046 --> 05:06.882
[eerie humming]
[诡异的嗡嗡声]

05:06.882 --> 05:10.786
[gasps] RUSTY'S RIB EYE!
- BUT WHERE'S RUSTY?
[喘气]拉斯蒂的肋眼牛排！
- 但是哪里生锈了？

05:22.565 --> 05:24.867
- [mumbles incoherently]
- [语无伦次地咕哝]

05:24.867 --> 05:26.769
- RUSTY RICKETS.
- 生锈的佝偻病。

05:26.769 --> 05:30.172
- A BIG GHOST?
I THOUGHT WE WERE--
- 一个大幽灵？
我以为我们是——

05:30.172 --> 05:32.141
WE WERE CONJURING
A RIB ROAST!
我们在变戏法
烤排骨！

05:32.141 --> 05:34.309
I'M OUTTA HERE!
我要离开这里！

05:34.309 --> 05:36.278
I'LL GET HELP, BUDDY!
我会寻求帮助，伙计！

05:36.278 --> 05:38.548
JUST GET ME
AWAY FROM THIS FREAK!
来找我吧
远离这个怪物！

05:38.548 --> 05:39.682
- [nervous chuckle]
- [紧张的笑声]

05:39.682 --> 05:42.017
HE MEANS "FREAK"
IN THE NICEST POSSIBLE WAY.
他的意思是“怪胎”
以尽可能最好的方式。

05:42.017 --> 05:44.987
ALL RIGHT, ENOUGH
OF THIS HOCUS POCUS HOOEY.
好吧，够了
这个骗局。

05:44.987 --> 05:47.823
TIME TO PUT IN SOME WORK.
是时候投入一些工作了。

05:47.823 --> 05:50.359
SAY, RUSTY, HOW 'BOUT
SPILLIN' THE BEANS
说，拉斯蒂，怎么样？
撒豆子

05:50.359 --> 05:52.462
ON THE OL'
"RUSTY ON RYE" RECIPE?
上OL'
“黑麦生锈”食谱？

05:52.462 --> 05:58.267
- [mumbles incoherently]
- [语无伦次地咕哝]

05:58.267 --> 06:00.135
FLIP, FLIP, FLIP.
FLA LA LA.
翻转，翻转，翻转。
弗拉拉拉。

06:00.135 --> 06:02.672
- OH, WELL, THAT WAS...
JUST GIBBERISH.
- 哦，好吧，那是……
只是胡言乱语。

06:02.672 --> 06:04.540
HMM, I GOT IT!
嗯，我明白了！

06:04.540 --> 06:06.208
HOW ABOUT
YOU WRITE DOWN THE RECIPE
怎么样
你写下食谱

06:06.208 --> 06:07.977
FOR THE CLASSIC
"NUMBER NINE"?
经典之作
“九号”？

06:07.977 --> 06:10.112
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

06:10.112 --> 06:12.648
- OH, RIGHT.
YOU'RE A GHOST. HMM.
- 哦，对了。
你是个幽灵。唔。

06:12.648 --> 06:14.316
WHAT IF YOU JUST SHOWED ME
HOW YOU MAKE ONE?
如果你给我看会怎样
你如何制作一个？

06:14.316 --> 06:15.818
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

06:21.491 --> 06:24.359
- WHOA!
- 哇！

06:24.359 --> 06:26.962
GEE, RUSTY, QUITE A SETUP
YOU GOT HERE,
哎呀，生锈了，真是一个设置
你到了这里，

06:26.962 --> 06:28.197
BUT WHERE'S
ALL THE SANDWICH BREAD?
但是在哪里
所有的三明治面包？

06:28.197 --> 06:29.932
THE CONDIMENTS?
THE COLD CUTS?
调味品？
冷盘？

06:29.932 --> 06:32.735
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

06:41.410 --> 06:44.514
- A RYE SANDWICH CARVED
ENTIRELY OF DRIFTWOOD?
- 黑麦三明治雕刻
完全是浮木吗？

06:44.514 --> 06:45.748
MAMMA MIA!
妈妈咪呀！

06:45.748 --> 06:48.183
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:48.183 --> 06:49.351
- SPACKLE.
- 斑点。

06:49.351 --> 06:50.853
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:50.853 --> 06:53.589
- SHELLAC.
- 虫胶。

06:53.589 --> 06:54.924
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

06:54.924 --> 06:56.258
- OH, YOU WANT ME
TO TRY IT?
- 哦，你想要我
要尝试一下吗？

06:56.258 --> 06:58.360
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

06:58.360 --> 06:59.995
- [chuckles] OKAY.
- [笑] 好吧。

06:59.995 --> 07:02.932
[sniffs]
MMM, SMELLS INDUSTRIAL.
[嗅嗅]
嗯，有工业味。

07:05.835 --> 07:08.838
UGH! UH, I'M SURE
IT'S AN ACQUIRED TASTE.
啊！呃，我确定
这是一种后天习得的品味。

07:11.941 --> 07:13.909
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

07:13.909 --> 07:16.378
IS THAT--
那是——

07:16.378 --> 07:17.446
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

07:17.446 --> 07:21.851
MMM, IT IS
A "RUSTY ON RYE"!
嗯，就是这样
“黑麦生锈”！

07:21.851 --> 07:26.822
GENTLEMEN, GET UP HERE.
THE "NUMBER NINE" IS BACK.
先生们，到这里来。
“九号”回来了。

07:26.822 --> 07:29.892
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

07:29.892 --> 07:35.898
[ghostly murmurs and laughter]
[幽灵般的低语和笑声]

07:35.898 --> 07:37.933
- HEY, I DIDN'T SUMMON
YOU GUYS.
- 嘿，我没有召唤
你们。

07:37.933 --> 07:41.370
- NO, THE ODOR
OF A "NUMBER NINE" DID.
- 不，是气味
“九号”做到了。

07:41.370 --> 07:44.574
- EVEN FROM WAY DOWN THERE.
- 即使是从很远的地方。

07:44.574 --> 07:45.808
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

07:45.808 --> 07:48.811
[cheering and laughter]
[欢呼和笑声]

07:50.680 --> 07:52.948
- UH-OH, LOOKS LIKE
WE'RE RUNNING LOW ON SHELLAC.
- 呃-哦，看起来像
我们的虫胶快用完了。

07:52.948 --> 07:53.949
I'LL GET SOME MORE.
我会再拿一些。

07:53.949 --> 07:58.387
[mumbling and groaning]
[咕哝和呻吟]

07:58.387 --> 08:04.326
[prolonged scream]
[长时间尖叫]

08:05.628 --> 08:07.597
BOY, THOSE GUYS
SURE CAN BE TERRIFYING.
男孩，那些家伙
确实很可怕。

08:09.899 --> 08:11.366
[munching]
[咀嚼]

08:11.366 --> 08:14.136
- YOU KNOW, THIS LITTLE SOIREE
COULDN'T HAVE HAPPENED
- 你知道，这个小晚会
这不可能发生

08:14.136 --> 08:15.938
WITHOUT OL' RUSTY HERE.
这里没有生锈。

08:15.938 --> 08:19.975
LET'S ALL GIVE A GHASTLY HOWL
FOR RUSTY RICKETS!
让我们一起发出可怕的嚎叫
对于生锈的佝偻病！

08:19.975 --> 08:22.511
[ghostly cheering]
[幽灵欢呼]

08:22.511 --> 08:25.147
- ALL RIGHT, GUYS,
I HATE TO BE A PARTY POOPER,
- 好吧，伙计们，
我讨厌成为派对扫兴者，

08:25.147 --> 08:26.448
BUT IT'S A LITTLE LATE
FOR ALL THIS NOISE.
但有点晚了
对于所有这些噪音。

08:26.448 --> 08:27.516
TIME TO WRAP IT UP.
是时候总结一下了。

08:27.516 --> 08:29.084
- OH!
- 哦！

08:29.084 --> 08:31.721
"BIG FACE" DOESN'T WANT US
“大脸”不要我们

08:31.721 --> 08:35.457
AS PATRONS ANYMORE.
不再是赞助人了。

08:35.457 --> 08:40.796
MAYBE WE SHOULD MAKE
LIKE A TREE AND LEAVE!
也许我们应该做
像一棵树一样离开！

08:40.796 --> 08:42.197
[maniacal laugh]
[疯狂的笑声]

08:42.197 --> 08:43.866
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:43.866 --> 08:47.202
- NOW, WAIT JUST A MINUTE!
THAT IS PRIVATE PROPERTY!
- 现在，等一下！
那是私有财产！

08:47.202 --> 08:48.704
MAYBE YOU GUYS SHOULD LEAVE.
也许你们应该离开。

08:48.704 --> 08:51.440
- OH, YEAH?
- 哦，是吗？

08:51.440 --> 08:55.010
- DO I HAVE TO CALL--
- 我需要打电话吗--

08:55.010 --> 08:57.012
EW, ECTOPLASM.
EW，外质。

08:57.012 --> 08:59.214
- ENOUGH FOOLING AROUND!
- 玩够了！

08:59.214 --> 09:01.383
LET'S HAVE
A GOOD OL' TIME...
让我们来吧
美好的时光...

09:01.383 --> 09:03.318
LIKE WE USED TO!
就像我们以前一样！

09:03.318 --> 09:06.355
[cheers and laughter]
[欢呼声和笑声]

09:06.355 --> 09:07.623
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:07.623 --> 09:10.459
[ghostly cheering]
[幽灵欢呼]

09:10.459 --> 09:13.863
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:13.863 --> 09:17.066
- YOU BETTER HAVE
A DARN GOOD REASON
- 你最好有
一个非常好的理由

09:17.066 --> 09:18.734
FOR GETTIN' ME
OUTTA BED, BOY.
为了得到我
起床了，男孩。

09:18.734 --> 09:23.939
[ghostly cheering and laughter]
[幽灵般的欢呼和笑声]

09:23.939 --> 09:25.908
- [ghostly laugh]
- [幽灵般的笑声]

09:25.908 --> 09:29.578
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:29.578 --> 09:31.847
- [retching]
- [干呕]

09:31.847 --> 09:33.582
- THAT GOOD ENOUGH FOR YOU?
- 对你来说够了吗？

09:33.582 --> 09:35.350
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:35.350 --> 09:36.686
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:36.686 --> 09:39.689
- MR. KRABS,
PATRICK, HELP!
- 先生。螃蟹，
帕特里克，救命！

09:39.689 --> 09:42.557
- SORRY, SPONGEBOB,
THIS IS A PART OF THE STORY
- 对不起，海绵宝宝，
这是故事的一部分

09:42.557 --> 09:43.959
WHERE I RUN AWAY AGAIN,
当我再次逃跑时，

09:43.959 --> 09:45.394
ONLY I DON'T KNOW
WHERE ELSE TO GO,
只有我不知道
还有哪里可以去，

09:45.394 --> 09:47.562
SO I'M JUST GOING TO GO
CIRCLE AROUND THE BUILDING!
所以我要走了
绕着大楼转一圈！

09:47.562 --> 09:51.500
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:54.103 --> 09:56.706
- LOOKS LIKE
A CERTAIN FOOLISH SPONGE
- 看起来像
某种愚蠢的海绵

09:56.706 --> 09:59.108
HAS BEEN CONVERSIN'
WITH THE UN-LIVIN'.
一直在交谈
与无生命的人一起。

09:59.108 --> 10:01.576
ALL RIGHT,
YOU FLOATIN' NUISANCES,
好吧，
你们这些漂浮的麻烦事，

10:01.576 --> 10:05.314
TIME FOR THE BOSS MAN
TO MOP UP.
老板的时间到了
清理干净。

10:05.314 --> 10:07.449
- [evil laugh]
- BATTER UP! H'YA!
- [邪恶的笑声]
- 连击！嗨！

10:07.449 --> 10:09.384
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

10:09.384 --> 10:12.487
- H'YA!
- 嗨！

10:12.487 --> 10:16.125
- [battle cry]
- [战斗呐喊]

10:18.928 --> 10:19.929
AH!
啊！

10:19.929 --> 10:21.263
all: HUH?
- OH!
全体：啊？
- 哦！

10:21.263 --> 10:23.032
OH!
哦！

10:23.032 --> 10:25.835
- YEAH, AND GO BACK
FROM WHENCE YE CAME!
- 是的，然后回去
你们从哪里来！

10:28.070 --> 10:29.905
[loud pop]
[爆裂声]

10:29.905 --> 10:32.507
- HI, MR. KRABS--
- NEVER HOLD A SEANCE, BOY-O,
- 嗨，先生。螃蟹--
- 永远不要举行降神会，男孩，

10:32.507 --> 10:34.343
WITHOUT ME PERMISSION,
未经我允许，

10:34.343 --> 10:36.912
BECAUSE GHOSTS
ARE LIKE RELATIVES,
因为鬼魂
就像亲人一样，

10:36.912 --> 10:40.449
ONCE YOU LET 'EM IN,
THEY'LL NEVER LEAVE.
一旦你让他们进来，
他们永远不会离开。

10:43.585 --> 10:46.321
- ORDER UP.
HERE'S YOUR "NUMBER NINE," SIR.
- 订购。
这是您的“九号”，先生。

10:49.391 --> 10:51.794
AND EVERYTHING WAS BETTER.
一切都变得更好了。

10:51.794 --> 10:54.229
- [eerie moan]
- WHAT'S THAT?
- [怪异的呻吟声]
- 那是什么？

10:54.229 --> 10:57.767
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

- [呻吟]